                                                "example_id": "29c0571f-8997-4fb6-b0c1-acf347f350ab",
                                                "sense_id": "81038935-d9a7-38a9-a0d5-20fd2052c777",
                                                "text": "The report for the half-year ended December 31st states that the gross earnings of the half-year are Rs.8,72,854 less, the working expenses Rs.1o,41,28o more, and the net earnings Rs.19,14,134 less than those of the corresponding halfyear of 1904."
                                            }
                                        ]
